{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:40:26+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:40:26+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"The Sage Group plc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Newcastle upon Tyne","website":"https://www.sage.com","employees":11094,"summary":"The Sage Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, offers technology solutions and services for small and medium businesses in North America, Europe, the United Kingdom, Ireland, Africa and Asia-Pacific. It offers Sage Intacct, cloud accounting and financial management software for mid-sized and growing businesses; Sage People, an integrated HR and Payroll solution; Sage 200, a scalable management solution; Sage X3, a flexible, intuitive, and tailored business solution; Sage Accounting, a cloud software for managing invoicing, cash flow, tax, and more, from anywhere. Ideal for small businesses; Sage Payroll for start-ups and small businesses manage their payroll; and Sage HR for small and mid-sized businesses for record management, leave management, staff scheduling, and expenses services. The company also provides Sage 50 accounts, that manages accounting, inventory, and payments, as well as Sage 50 payroll. The Sage Group plc was formerly known as Ployfinal Public Limited Company and changed its name to The Sage Group plc in September 1988. The company was founded in 1981 and is based in Newcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Sage Group plc, avec ses filiales, offre des solutions technologiques et des services aux petites et moyennes entreprises en Amérique du Nord, en Europe, au Royaume-Uni, en Irlande, en Afrique et en Asie-Pacifique. Il offre Sage Intacct, un logiciel de comptabilité et de gestion financière en nuage pour les entreprises de taille moyenne et en croissance; Sage People, une solution intégrée de RH et de paie; Sage 200, une solution de gestion évolutive; Sage X3, une solution d'entreprise flexible, intuitive et sur mesure; Sage Accounting, un logiciel en nuage pour gérer la facturation, les flux de trésorerie, les impôts et plus encore, de n'importe où. Idéal pour les petites entreprises; Sage Payroll pour les start-ups et les petites entreprises gèrent leur paie; et Sage HR pour les petites et moyennes entreprises pour la gestion des dossiers, la gestion des congés, la planification du personnel et les services de dépenses."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":10378818560,"shares_outstanding":900548227,"trailing_pe":29.551283,"forward_pe":20.1303,"price_to_book":4842.437,"ev_to_ebitda":19.452,"ev_to_revenue":4.623,"dividend_yield":0.0196,"payout_ratio":0.5502,"beta_yahoo":0.349},"targets":{"current_price":1152.5,"mean":1147.579,"median":1160.0,"high":1400.0,"low":850.0,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":1.78947,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-19"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":687000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-04","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00871,"institutions_pct":0.84906995,"institutions_float_pct":0.85653,"institutions_n":423,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":9183,"value":10583407,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0381}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.015,"shares":13541840,"value":15606970600,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0145000005},{"name":"HARTFORD MUTUAL Fd.S II INC-Hartford Schroders Intl Stock Fd.","pct":0.0125,"shares":11315503,"value":13041117207,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.042},{"name":"VANGUARD WORLD FUND-Vanguard International Growth Fund","pct":0.0111,"shares":10030473,"value":11560120132,"date":"2026-05-31","chg":0.14649999},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0099,"shares":8923850,"value":10284737125,"